/*
  DrivingDynamicsWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0044 · DrivingDynamicsWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DrivingDynamicsWidget` resolves (table "DrivingDynamicsWidget") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The parity keys are the exact strings extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/DrivingDynamicsWidget.tsx + registry/driving.ts).
  The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry,
  empty/error/banner copy, chart + accessibility).
*/

